  rationale "Issue #1164 code-example decomposition, browser twin (R1164-11, JS-first doctrine). JavaScript twin of rust/src/code_example_knowledge.rs (decompose against the seed vocabulary and grammar registry, generalize across languages, recompose from the aligned example bodies, step records and Links Notation renderers), added 2026-10-07; growth is the ported decomposer, not silent regrowth. Re-baselined 333 to 339 on 2026-10-07 for R1164-9, the print prose relation (kind print_stdout) that lets a held-out language such as Pascal learn its output call from its documentation, mirrored from the native decomposer."
